%N A023584 Greatest exponent in prime-power factorization of 2*prime(n)-1.
%H A023584 Amiram Eldar, <a href="/A023584/b023584.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a> (terms 1..1000 from Harvey P. Dale)
%F A023584 a(n) = A051903(A076274(n+1)). - _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 22 2026
%t A023584 Max[Transpose[FactorInteger[2 #-1]][[2]]]&/@Prime[Range[100]] (* _Harvey P. Dale_, Dec 12 2012 *)
%o A023584 (PARI) a(n) = vecmax(factor(2*prime(n)-1)[,2]); \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 22 2026
